# Spell levels (feat_spell_levels.py): Lucia at level 1 (index 0 at 0x020B46C0) opens
# Special in the first temple battle after Jian Fights; the list shows the spells learned by then:
# Healing Water alone. Shots spells_lv1 and, after Down, spells_lv1_down. Run with --save.
include party2_strong
pin u32 0x020b46c0 0
wait 270
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
shot spells_lv1
press Down 8
wait 30
shot spells_lv1_down
